 "statement": "Concrete Lean Core arithmetic only: M divides p+1; 28M is smaller than p+1; K*W0 is smaller than p+1-28M; and (M-1)/2 exceeds 2^52, for p=2^255-19, M=60824497*213156431, L=4M, W0=16L(L-1)(L-2)(L-3), K=2^28. Producer proof-gate passed four declarations with no trusted native exceptions; this does not prove the geometric energy lemma, any solver bound or a new attack exponent."
